cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use ATLAS-Σ or its NEXUS-PAY benchmark, please cite it as below."
title: "ATLAS-Σ: a multi-rail settlement and liquidity digital twin"
abstract: >-
  Deterministic, event-sourced simulator of large-value (RTGS/LSM) and instant
  (FedNow-style, RTP-style) payment rails with a hash-chained ledger, liquidity
  auction, MPC and constrained-RL treasury controllers, and the NEXUS-PAY
  benchmark. All data is synthetic.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Manivannan
    given-names: Akilan
repository-code: "https://github.com/AkilanManivannanak/ATLAS"
version: 0.6.0
date-released: 2026-11-10
keywords: [payments, RTGS, liquidity, settlement, digital twin, market design, safe reinforcement learning]
